58,"text":"それ以外に、あそこの船を見たか？あれは俺のもう一つの…コツだ。","nextNodeIds":[728090220]},{"nodeId":728090220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3083,"speakerName":"ハリソン","textMapHash":142163258,"text":"あの船に乗れば、お前たちはここからこっそり鳴神島に行ける。へへ、とても便利だろう？","nextNodeIds":[728090221]},{"nodeId":728090221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2262830738,"text":"なんで「こっそり」…","nextNodeIds":[728090222]},{"nodeId":728090222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3083,"speakerName":"ハリソン","textMapHash":3801958178,"text":"あっ、とりあえず…いざっていう時のために。","nextNodeIds":[728090223]},{"nodeId":728090223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3083,"speakerName":"ハリソン","textMapHash":1515478210,"text":"さて、俺は戻って貨物の点検をするから、失礼するよ。もう一度礼を言う、旅人。","nextNodeIds":[728090224]},{"nodeId":728090224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3083,"speakerName":"ハリソン","textMapHash":336760946,"text":"貨物を受け入れる場所を変えないといけないようだ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":728090208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":894507786,"text":"ここで何しているの？","nextNodeIds":[728090209]},{"nodeId":728090209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3083,"speakerName":"ハリソン","textMapHash":23007746,"text":"俺は…貨物を運んでるんだ、ははは、貨物を運んでる…","nextNodeIds":[728090210]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7280902,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133209046,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_UI","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_FINISH","LNHLPKELCAL":["3083"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"ta